<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-U.S. OPENING TOUR MATCH POSTPONED.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-U.S. OPENING TOUR MATCH POSTPONED.</headline>
<dateline>NEWPORT, Wales 1997-01-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The United States opening rugby union tour match against Emerging Wales,  due to be played at Cardiff Arms Park on Wednesday has been postponed due to an ice-bound pitch.</p>
</text>
